\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Critical difference diagram for all 13 configurations (112 UCR datasets, Nemenyi test at $\alpha {=}0.05$). MSRF-augmented variants (red labels) consistently rank higher than their non-augmented counterparts. The individual non-convolutional spaces (TRF, GRF, SRF) rank lowest, confirming that their value lies in combination.}}{12}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
