\newlabel{fig:cd_efficiency}{{4}{12}{Critical difference diagram for the feature efficiency comparison (112 datasets). MSRF\textsubscript {full} (500 conv + 410 non-conv = 1{,}410 dims), CRF\textsubscript {700} (700 conv $\times $ 2 = 1{,}400 dims), and CRF\textsubscript {only} (500 conv $\times $ 2 = 1{,}000 dims). At a matched dimensionality budget, multi-space allocation ranks first}{figure.4}{}}
